        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "How do I do that? Will a city answer me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_013",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Heh. I will, on its behalf."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "And it says, 'I don't mind.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Ah Faat, you have always been - and always will be - one of Lungmen's best."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_013",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "Thank you, Madam Ch'en. Thank you so much."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "Madam Chen, there are two things I'd like you to relay to Madam Oni."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_013",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "You should tell her yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_013",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "What do you mean? Are you saying..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_013"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "...Boss?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "avg_npc_013",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "It's me. I'm right here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_013"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, you should've told me sooner."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "She chose to not say anything."
    },
