    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "Boss, did I do a good job?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Not good enough. You can't call it a good job until you survive to see things through."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "Well damn, haha... I've already used up my luck to have you carry me on your back, Boss."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Anywhere you want to go? You always refused to tell me where you came from."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "Here, Lungmen. As a matter of fact, I've never been to other cities. If possible, just bury me in that old place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "The hideout? But... that place is a complete wreck now, long deserted. To be honest, I'm not sure how I'd clean it up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Informant",
        "text": "It's okay. As long as I'm... with the others."
